  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Id'fix, in Trans-en-Provence, is a salon used to long-haired dogs, which need more meticulous care than short coats. One positive review praises the punctuality and welcome given to a basset hound. The salon has moved: it is now at the Centre Commercial Arcadia, 555 route de Draguignan — the same phone number (04 94 84 58 22) as at the former avenue de la Gare address is still associated with it, which confirms it is the same business.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: Id'fix has indeed moved — head to the Centre Commercial Arcadia (555 route de Draguignan) rather than avenue de la Gare; the phone number is unchanged.</div>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>If your dog has a long coat prone to matting (Collie, Beauceron, Cocker Spaniel...), this salon is used to that type of care.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: between salon visits, regular brushing prevents mats that form quickly with a long coat, especially by the sea with salt and sand.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Trans-en-Provence is a village near Draguignan; the salon is on the route de Draguignan, at the Centre Commercial Arcadia. Worth checking before you go: hours and prices, not published in the sources we read (not re-read on an official website on 06/11/2026: only a directory and Groomie confirm the address and phone number).</p>
